/* Word Café data.
   To add more words: copy a group block, change the text, keep the same shape.
   Each word has:
   - w    : the word, lowercase letters only, 11 letters or fewer (it must fit the wheel)
   - m    : simple meaning
   - ex   : an easy example sentence that contains the word (shown when learning)
   - tip  : memory trick (root, family, or an everyday picture). Never reuse the same trick.
   - fam  : word family (optional)
   - s    : a tricky fill-in sentence with ____ . Only ONE option may fit.
   - d    : 3 wrong options (close in meaning, so they are confusing)
   - why  : simple reason why the answer is right and the others are not
   Each group has 5 words and one quote (use ____ where the answer goes).
   Avoid "a/an" right before ____ because it gives the answer away. */
